// Author: Calvin Quint
// GitHub: https://github.com/calvin-quint/docs/blob/main/01-detection-engineering/kql/data-exfiltration/user_email_attachments_lookup.kql
// User Email Attachments Sent ($UPN lookup template)
// MITRE ATT&CK: N/A — investigation lookup, not a standalone detection
// Detects: Parameterized query listing every email with an attachment sent
//          by a given user ($UPN). Used to build an outbound-attachment
//          timeline during an insider-threat or account-compromise
//          investigation rather than to trigger on its own.
// Entity mapping: Account → Address → $UPN (substitute the value under investigation)
EmailEvents
| where SenderFromAddress contains "$UPN"
| where AttachmentCount > 0
